FR-10.1 Rejected station correction preserves record
Start from the application as first loaded.
Open station setup and add stations named “Alpha” and “Bravo”.
Edit “Bravo” to “ Alpha ” and save.
Expected: A visible validation message identifies the duplicate station name, and station setup still shows “Bravo”.

FR-10.2 Rejected timetable correction preserves record
Start from the application as first loaded.
Open station setup and add stations named “Alpha” and “Bravo”.
Open timetable setup and add a Weekday pattern from “Alpha” to “Bravo” from 08:00 to 09:00 with Low baseline crowding.
Edit the pattern end time to 08:00 and save.
Expected: A visible validation message identifies the invalid time range, and the saved pattern still ends at 09:00.

FR-10.3 Saved prediction cannot be changed
