Open station setup and add stations named “Alpha” and “Bravo”.
Open timetable setup and add a Weekday pattern from “Alpha” to “Bravo” from 08:00 to 09:00 with Low baseline crowding.
Plan a journey from “Alpha” to “Bravo” on 2024-06-03 at 08:30 and request a prediction.
